Lesson 5.4 · Internal Systems & Operations
The planning and reporting calendar

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Put all your yearly cycles on one calendar from your first year to avoid last-minute rushes.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Build backwards from fixed dates and deadlines.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Mark unknown dates 'to confirm when registered'.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Add your own seasons, including months when cash is tight.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You draft your first annual planning and reporting calendar.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

